{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20250","headline":"吊卢殷 四 · 孟郊","name":"吊卢殷 四","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"登封草木深，登封道路微。\n日月不与光，莓苔空生衣。\n可怜无子翁，蚍蜉缘病肌。\n挛卧岁时长，涟涟但幽噫。\n幽噫虎豹闻，此外相访稀。\n至亲唯有诗，抱心死有归。\n河南韩先生，後君作因依。\n磨一片嵌岩，书千古光辉。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"孟郊","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_20250.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_20250","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}